	(label "SQ" (at 178 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f7efbbba-67a3-5d6c-9f54-4d2ce68abbe2"))
	(label "PTT" (at 200 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "27476d98-6312-554a-8218-a5a32b5de9c5"))
	(label "HL" (at 200 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "00043edf-88a2-5601-a9fd-2429d34c20ed"))
	(label "SA_RXD" (at 210 200.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4763da84-08f8-5c15-b82c-5ff758ae1cb2"))
	(label "SA_TXD" (at 210 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "72140821-aa73-52d3-9ebb-46171e9e96f4"))
	(text "rdio: SA818S radio interface (hardware only). Direct pin-to-pin wiring; only +3V3, VBAT and GND use rail symbols. Pin numbers = NodeMCU ESP32S 38pin header." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "4c1818b5-3fcc-5836-be01-fad56360ad71"))
	(text "U2 is drawn in the module's real pin layout (datasheet pinout, top view): pins 7..1 top, 12..18 bottom, 8..11 left. Footprint rdio:DRA818_SA818 (pad pattern taken from the rdio project, check against the module). Two unnumbered right-side pads are not in the symbol." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 262.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "41c3ffa7-ea25-5553-a737-1b330526b65d"))
	(text "AF_OUT (700mV, 200 ohm) -> C1 -> node B (R1||R2 = 1.65V bias) -> GPIO34 (ADC1_CH6). GPIO25 DAC -> C4 -> R3 100k / R4 1k -> MIC_IN (about -40 dB), C5 33nF low-pass. MIC_IN impedance unknown: verify at bench." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 267 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "8fb10f93-354d-5919-b7cf-da8be643c3b8"))
	(text "PTT (GPIO21, open-drain): R5 pull-up -> reset/crash = receive. PD (pin 6) tied to 3V3: module always on. H/L (GPIO19, software controlled): output low = low power, release = high power. NEVER drive high." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 271.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "906de1bc-8468-53d4-b299-4d33e6521939"))
	(text "SQ (SA818S pin 1 'Audio ON', low while receiving) -> GPIO22 direct. UART2: GPIO17 TX -> RXD pin 16; TXD pin 17 -> GPIO16 RX, direct. 9600 8N1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 276 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0e27e806-8a72-51d5-b038-0a052df4d41e"))
	(text "Power: 5V comes from the NodeMCU own USB-C through its VIN pin (pin 19, net VIN_ESP). The module VBAT hangs off it through R9 (0R link); FB1 + C8 are DO NOT POPULATE (fit FB1 + C8 and remove R9 to try the filter). The radio draws up to 0.75A in TX: use a USB source rated >= 1A. Do not power the module from the NodeMCU 3V3 pin. Fit antenna or dummy load before transmitting." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 280.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "69e068c2-ffc7-5b70-8b33-48b183aaf824"))
	(wire (pts (xy 254 190.5) (xy 254 210.82)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "30c3ad3d-f3a9-5081-a51e-e616229e6809"))
